	(text "USB 2.0 full-speed device on PA11/PA12 (fixed USB pins);\n  STM32WB has the series R and the D+ pull-up inside.\nA6/B6 and A7/B7 are joined at the receptacle; the stub\n  stays < 3.5 mm and the ESD part is not on it\n  (interface-layout §4, AN4871).\nU601 USBLC6-2SC6 at the connector, routed through its\n  pins (connector -> I/O pin -> MCU), no via before it;\n  channel 1 on D-, channel 2 on D+ (symmetric part).\n  VBUS pin to VBUS with C602 100 nF at the pin.\nD+/D- class DIFF_90: 90 ohm differential (USB 2.0;\n  interface-layout §3); FS is tolerant of mismatch.\nVBUS: C601 4.7 uF (1-10 uF for a device, AN26.2);\n  D202 (sheet 2) blocks back-feed from 24 V.\nCC1/CC2: Rd 5.1k to GND (sink, default USB power).\n  No CC ESD part in the parts list: deviation D-008.\nShield to GND directly (no metal enclosure, D-008)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "948d22ed-a34c-5d7c-9296-3e1d1ef58e9a")
	)
	(text "Sink: Rd on each CC line (mcu-circuit-design §8)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 115.57 0)
		(effects
